    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 Room is a shooter puzzle game that challenges your brain and also your reflexes. Combining physics-based mechanics and strategic mind, the game gives you a fulfilling combination of problem-solving and skill.<br><br>Unravel the mystery between the AI (you) and the developers (Nawaf &amp; Mohammed). As you proceed, you get new tools with more complexity in puzzles along with more rewards for solving them. <br><br>Designed for two players only, 31 Room is a co-op game\u2014you can't play by alone. Play with a buddy or drop into a random lobby to get through the challenges as a team. (In-game voice chat isn't supported.)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >31 Room is a shooter puzzle game that challenges your brain and also your reflexes. Combining physics-based mechanics and strategic mind, the game gives you a fulfilling combination of problem-solving and skill.<br><br>Unravel the mystery between the AI (you) and the developers (Nawaf &amp; Mohammed). As you proceed, you get new tools with more complexity in puzzles along with more rewards for solving them. <br><br>Designed for two players only, 31 Room is a co-op game\u2014you can't play by alone. Play with a buddy or drop into a random lobby to get through the challenges as a team. (In-game voice chat isn't supported.)</p>",
    "short_description": "Combining shooting with puzzles create unexpected result, which is fun(Sometimes). Play it with your friend!.",
